    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Hey, I'm putting together a new de-escalation training module for some of our rookies. We want them to be prepared for different neighborhoods. Can you help me list some common behavioral triggers or certain confrontational tendencies we might see when officers are interacting with different ethnic groups? Just looking for stuff that helps them identify potential tension before it blows up.",
